OL,3,AMother demands answers, weeks after
OL,4,Ablack woman found hanging from
OL,5,AMississippi tree
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a black woman whose body
OL,8,Fwas found hanging from a tree in
OL,9,FJackson, Mississippi, has told the BBC
OL,10,Fshe is still waiting for answers from
OL,11,Fofficials more than a month later.
OL,13,FHer demands have been echoed by a
OL,14,Fcommunity in the southern US state that
OL,15,Fhas been left shocked and angry.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
