OL,3,AMother demands answers, weeks after
OL,4,Ablack woman found hanging from
OL,5,AMississippi tree
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter weeks of silence, police on
OL,8,FTuesday confirmed for the first time
OL,9,Fthat they were investigating the death
OL,10,Fof Tasia Fortune, 29, as a potential
OL,11,Fhomicide - while clarifying that her
OL,12,Fofficial cause of death has yet to be
OL,13,Fconfirmed.
OL,15,FAuthorities discovered Fortune's body
OL,16,Fon 3 August, hanging from a tree in the
OL,17,Flot of an abandoned home.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
